        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Ritson 1315-622, Exterior Ornamental Gate Closer</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Exterior Gate Closer is for use on ornamental iron gates. It can accommodate a gate  54\" wide by 120\" tall weighing up to 250 lbs. Built for exterior use, it has all weather fluid and the track has a pass thru hole to avoid debris build-up. All the components are rust-resistant. The Rixson 1315 has a black finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G47G1_size.gif?v=1704354606\" width=\"457\" height=\"359\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Rixson 1315 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Rixson 1315 Gate Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black</b></li>\r\n<li>Maximum Gate Size: 4'6\" x 10'0\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 250 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Track has pass thru hole to avoid debris build-up</li>\r\n<li>Components are rust-resistant</li>\r\n<li>May be mounted on cross-member or spokes</li>\r\n<li>Pull side mount</li>\r\n<li>Includes closer body, mounting bracket, arm and slide track</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/rixon-1351.pdf?v=1718159616\" target=\"new\"><b>Rixon 1351 Gate Closer Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<I><b>***This item is a special order with 4-5 week lead time and is not returnable***</b></i>\r\n</p>",
